      "clause_number": "1",
      "title": "Scope",
      "content": "Scope: This Indian Standard (IS 15477 : 2019) covers and specifies requirements for Adhesives for Use with Ceramic, Mosaic and Stone Tiles - Specification (First Revision). It applies to cement_paints under paints_coatings category in the chemicals_polymers domain.",
